{"id":"vod_lz_144536","vodId":"144536","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"LV999的村民","name_cn":"LV999的村民","date":"2026-01-01","year":"2026","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20260702-1/934ec7866d8e29f91e7c9af70d46bd5c.webp"},"summary":"剑与魔法的世界——艾斯克里亚。在这个世界里，人们生来就背负着等级与既定使命。战士、格斗家、僧侣、魔法师、盗贼、商人、猎人、咒术师、国王、贤者、勇者。而其中数量最多、毫无力量、最弱小的角色……“村民”。                                                                      　　某日，一对村民父子遭遇魔物袭击。当那位青年飒爽登场，轻松击倒怪物时，那对父子惊得目瞪口呆。“镜浩二、村民……等级……999！？”达到 LV999 的极致境界，反抗既定命运的村民——镜浩二。魔族之巅的魔王之女——爱丽丝。两人相遇后，与伙伴们共同追寻魔族与人类共存的理想。在这个被命运赋予“对立”的世界里等待着他们的，将是这个世界不为人知的法则……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-10-08 01:08:39","episodeCount":12,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260702/7839_02ca759d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260702/7838_933eea4b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260709/8132_44e249d1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260716/8495_a20db156/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260723/8808_2a605b0e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260730/9104_1ccaff7c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260806/9418_2c81a2ee/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260813/9736_9441f7e2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260820/10095_b2b7ce36/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260827/10555_f2096aa2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260903/10882_ef60bb13/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/20260910/11180_e6ccf33f/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:56:12.332Z"}